### 1. Health Check
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health

### 2. Register New User
# @name register
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Radhika Sharma",
  "email": "radhika@seventhraylegaltech.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "companyName": "Seventh Ray LegalTech Solutions"
}

### 3. Login User
# @name login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "radhika@seventhraylegaltech.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}


### 1. Upload Contract (Multipart with sample text contract)
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}
POST http://localhost:8080/api/contracts/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Master Engineering & EPC Contract
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="clientName"

Apex Infrastructure Ltd.
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="contractType"

EPC
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="value"

750000.00
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="startDate"

2026-11-16
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="endDate"

2028-11-16
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="contract.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

1. PARTIES: Seventh Ray LegalTech Solutions and Apex Infrastructure Ltd.
2. PAYMENT TERMS: Payments shall be made within thirty (30) days of invoice date.
3. TERMINATION: Either party may terminate with sixty (60) days prior written notice.
4. CONFIDENTIALITY: Proprietary materials shall be protected for five (5) years.
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 2. List All Contracts
GET http://localhost:8080/api/contracts
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 3. Get Contract Details by ID (View Full Parsed Text)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/contracts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 4. Test State Machine: VALID Step 1 (DRAFT -> UNDER_REVIEW)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/contracts/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "UNDER_REVIEW"
}

### 5. Test State Machine: VALID Step 2 (UNDER_REVIEW -> APPROVED)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/contracts/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "APPROVED"
}

### 6. Test State Machine: FORBIDDEN Transition (Test Error Handling -> triggers 400 Bad Request)
# Contract is now APPROVED. It is FORBIDDEN to jump directly backwards to DRAFT!
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/contracts/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "DRAFT"
}

### 7. Download File
GET http://localhost:8080/api/contracts/1/download
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}